{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shrouded Lands is a turn-based combat game. Observe your enemies, understand their behaviour and plan most effective offensive and defensive actions. Or try to disturb their strategy using spiritual actions, to make them more predictable and limited in their actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/a3b285e4a297628986c746dcddbdfaad.poster.avif?t=1757601112\" width=780 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/a3b285e4a297628986c746dcddbdfaad.webm?t=1757601112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/a3b285e4a297628986c746dcddbdfaad.mp4?t=1757601112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through Shrouded lands full of dangers and the unknown. Fight enemy parties or try to avoid them through swamps or thickets. Search for supplies, ingredients and armor.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/d353ff64bdecc40e23f777822fc23869.poster.avif?t=1757601112\" width=800 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/d353ff64bdecc40e23f777822fc23869.webm?t=1757601112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/d353ff64bdecc40e23f777822fc23869.mp4?t=1757601112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three characte